# Copy to .env (git-ignored) or export in the shell. Keep the data outside the repository.
HORSETRACK_DATA_DIR=~/Data/horsetrack
# A value may be wrapped in one pair of matching quotes ("..." or '...'); they are stripped.
# A value set in the shell environment is used as is and wins over this file.
# JRDB-derived feature sets (the workout features, #137): on unless 0, false, off or no.
# JRDB data is licensed for private use only: never show its outputs to anyone else.
# HORSETRACK_JRDB_FEATURES=1
# The JRDB member account of `horsetrack japan jrdb fetch` (#718). Never commit a value.
# Its password lives only in the macOS keychain item of service jrdb (docs/specs/jrdb-fetch.md).
# HORSETRACK_JRDB_ACCOUNT=
